---
import { url } from "../lib/url";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About ACTONA" current="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href={url("/")}>Home</a><span class="breadcrumb__sep">/</span>About ACTONA</div>
    <h1>About ACTONA</h1>

    <p>
      The Department of ACTONA is responsible for the collection, preservation and
      analysis of historical records and materials of public interest. The Department
      maintains a public archive, coordinates field recovery work, and publishes
      research and archival materials as review permits.
    </p>
    <p>
      The Department also operates an official news portal, providing citizens with
      reliable updates on current events, discoveries and announcements.
    </p>

    <h2>Responsibilities</h2>
    <p>
      The Department's remit covers the cataloguing of recovered materials, the
      preservation of historical documents and photographs, and the coordination of
      research across affiliated fields including archaeology, archival analysis and
      anthropology.
    </p>

    <h2>Public Access</h2>
    <p>
      Most departmental records are published for public reference. Some materials
      remain under review and may be marked as restricted or withheld pending
      verification; their status is shown on the relevant record.
    </p>

    <h2>Structure</h2>
    <p>
      The Department operates through field recovery units, research staff and a
      central archive office responsible for cataloguing and public communication.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
